WEBVTT

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:39.950
On our trip to New York, we saw a stone
tablet emitting a strange power in Judy's lab.

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:44.950
Max reunites with his
childhood friend, Allen.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:50.750
Allen invited Max to a Beyblade
tournament that'd be happening the next day.

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:55.970
But that night, a mysterious group
of thieves stole the stone tablet.

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:58.090
Wait up!!

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:04.060
Go!

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:16.110
Run!

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:20.370
Wait up, darn it!

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.830
Max...

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:23.870
Allen?

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:31.000
And to our surprise,
Allen appears among the thieves...!

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:48.100
New York ain't the biggest
metropolis in the world for nothing!

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:51.810
No matter where I look
it's nothing but buildings!

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:53.190
Takao!

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:53.860
What?

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:56.860
Why're you over here
talking like a tourist?

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:02.200
I'm surprised you can stay calm
while your teammate is depressed!

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:07.200
Cheer up, Max.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:11.960
Bladers from all over New York
will be watching the battle today.

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:12.920
Yeah...

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:17.340
Max, how long are
you gonna mope?

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.920
Can you really fight an
exciting battle like that?

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:21.680
Hey, stop that.

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:24.260
I still can't believe it.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:28.520
I can't believe that Allen's
one of the criminals.

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:30.440
No, I don't want to believe it!

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.690
It must be a big shock...

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:35.110
I can't blame you, since
he's your childhood friend.

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:37.610
Your mom feels the same way, Max.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:40.820
Allen is an excellent and very
intelligent research assistant.

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:44.780
I don't think he could ever be
behind stealing the tablet.

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:47.700
Maybe you got the wrong person?

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:50.410
But... that was...

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:03.130
That was Allen,
no doubt about it.

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:11.980
One thing sure is strange though; would a suspect even show up to the tournament?

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:14.850
Yeah, you'd think
he wouldn't show.

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:18.320
And it's weird that he'd
invite you to begin with.

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:23.780
More importantly, Max, are you going
to participate in the match or not?

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:24.950
Huh?

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:30.660
If you're that worried about it,
I don't mind going in your place.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:31.660
Kai...

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:34.250
No.

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:38.540
I'll go. If Allen shows
up at the arena,

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:41.050
I'll ask him directly.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:44.680
I want to hear the
whole story from him.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:48.550
Yeah, that's the spirit.
Moping isn't going to do any good.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:52.980
It's better to just clash head
on with the guy, Max.

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:58.560
I'm glad you finally cheered up.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:04:59.570
Mom!

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:04.150
Why don't you use
this in your match?

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.990
It's the new Draciel.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:11.790
Draciel Viper.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:14.500
Wow, thank you, mom!

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:19.040
Draciel Viper has a special
metal set into the Spin Gear,

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:22.550
which gives its defense and
endurance a considerable increase.

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.920
Just you wait, Allen.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.470
Aww, must be nice!

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:30.180
It's not fair that Max gets
one and I don't, old lady!

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:34.180
You can't play favorites
just because he's your son.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:40.770
Don't worry! I'm working with dad to
give your Dragoon a proper upgrade!

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:42.440
Really?

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:46.530
Max's mom is the best!

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:49.280
And a real beauty for sure, yeah!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:01.590
Here's the Beyblade as promised.
It's called the Impulse.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.800
A piece of the stone tablet
is inside the Impulse...

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:11.760
I should be able to summon a Sacred Beast with this, right? Awesome!

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:18.770
Our plan was able to succeed thanks to your job at the research facility.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.440
That's your paycheck.

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:26.740
Time to go, boss.

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.360
See ya, Allen.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:32.280
Good luck.

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:46.340
We've got an uninvited guest.

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.510
Huh?

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.090
The fuzz.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:50.760
N-no way!

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.390
Just go.

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:53.350
Yes, ma'am!

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:58.060
Hey.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:58.940
Got it!

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.410
What a pain. Floor it.

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:55.030
Can you see them from above?

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.240
We lost 'em!

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:57.660
Unbelievable!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:01.710
Our last remaining lead is that boy.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:02.960
Allen, huh?

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:05.040
Do we have intel on his whereabouts?

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:09.050
He's entered in a Beyblade
tournament at Yankee Stadium.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:23.890
All right, everyone!
It's time for today's main battle!

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:27.520
Our special guests to add
some flair to today's tournament!

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:31.280
Let's give 'em a big welcome!

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:37.070
The best Bladers in the world, the BBA team!

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:38.870
Hey, come on out!

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.160
Yay! Hello, hello!

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:51.760
The entrant from this team will be
our own New York star, Max Mizuhara!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:54.550
Darn, I wanna battle, too!

00:08:55.550 --> 00:09:01.390
Their challenger will be the boy who made a name
for himself by winning the tournament in the Bronx!

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:04.100
Allen Mackenzie!

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:22.700
Sorry for the wait!
Allen's coming on stage!

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:23.750
Allen...

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:28.170
Hey, Allen! Give us a real good battle!

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:35.010
This is going to be
a one-round battle!

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:37.550
Players, are you ready?

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:40.260
Max, keep your guard up!

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:44.270
Before we battle,
I have something to ask you.

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:48.480
What were you doing
out there last night?

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:52.400
What do you have to do with
the group that stole the tablet?

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:55.150
If you beat me, I'll tell you.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.360
What?

00:09:56.360 --> 00:10:00.570
For the record, if you think I haven't improved
since before, you're in for a rude awakening.

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:04.250
I couldn't beat you before,
but that's in the past.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:07.290
Now I'm the champion of the Bronx.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.130
And I'm not gonna
go easy on you.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:17.260
Plus, I've got a special
little friend with me this time.

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:19.890
Come on!

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.560
Bladers, ready?

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:27.230
Three! Two! One!

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:29.350
Go, Shoot!

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:47.500
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:58.970
Whoa! Allen and Max are bringing out the
intense attacks right out of the gate!

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:01.970
Go, Impulse!
Take him down!

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:16.980
It's just as Judy said, the new
Draciel has increased stamina.

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:20.150
But he's not gonna win
by staying on defense!

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:23.410
Hey, Max! What the heck's
your problem?! Fight back!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.740
Attack! Ya gotta attack!

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:31.460
Uh oh, Draciel's in trouble!

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:36.000
Come on, Max!
If you won't attack, I will!

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:40.670
Go, Impulse!

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.060
Impulse...!

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:51.440
What's up with those movements?

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:53.020
It's an elliptical movement!

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:57.610
The Impulse isn't spinning in
a perfect circle, it's an ellipse!

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.610
What's that mean?

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.150
What's the point?

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:03.160
The swerving path of the
elliptical movement creates waves

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:06.280
and it decreases Draciel's rotation speed!

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:10.790
He's done his homework
on Draciel's defense.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.790
What's up with Max's Draciel?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.380
It's struggling real
hard down there!

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:25.970
How odd...

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:30.430
Draciel Viper should be able
to withstand those attacks.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.560
What's wrong with you, Max?

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.690
I can't concentrate...

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:41.440
Allen's like a totally
different person...

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:53.660
Max is holding back!

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:57.210
He's conflicted. He doesn't
have the will to battle!

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:57.790
Huh?

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:59.250
What'd you say?!

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:02.880
Hey, Max! Get your act together
and start battling for real!

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:05.510
I know... I really do...

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:06.680
Max!

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:10.640
You better not be holding back!

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:13.230
Yeah...

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:15.940
Are you insulting me?

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:19.110
Then I'll make you fight for real!

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:21.480
Rise, my Sacred Beast!

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:26.910
His Sacred Beast?

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.410
Can he use one?

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:29.660
Allen...

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:33.370
What're you doing, you Sacred Beast? You're up!

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:40.960
Could Allen be using a piece of the stolen
tablet to try and summon a Sacred Beast?

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:44.470
Wait, that was an
incomplete Sacred Beast, right?

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:48.430
Max's mom said summoning
one wouldn't be so simple!

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:51.510
But what if he was
able to pull it off?

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:54.980
Just look. There's no sign
of a Sacred Beast anywhere!

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:58.730
My Sacred Beast!
Sacred Beast!

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:01.230
What's wrong, my Sacred Beast?! Get out here!

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.690
Allen...

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:22.670
Look at that!
Both Bladers, Stadium Out!

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:33.260
What a twist! What force! The battle
between Max and Allen will restart!

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:39.940
Why? Why didn't my
Sacred Beast come out?

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:41.650
Allen...

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.150
Judy.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.700
Inspector Scott.

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.240
We can't let this slide.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:53.620
Why?

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:57.660
We need to ask Allen about
this situation immediately.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.120
No can do.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:03.170
I imagine he won't say anything
until this battle is over.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:08.720
Please. Can you leave this to Max?

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:10.430
To Max?

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:14.890
Allen promised to tell
us everything if he lost.

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:17.720
Max should make
him keep to his word.

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:19.390
Judy...

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:22.600
He stole such an important
stone from your lab!

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:28.190
Which is exactly I don't want to
force him and lose our lead.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.660
Fine. I'll wait.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:37.160
But one way or another,
I will make Allen talk.

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:51.300
This isn't what she promised! The boss said
she made it so I could control the Sacred Beast...

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:52.680
But the Impulse...

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.300
You've been fooled!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:55.350
What?!

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:59.180
Did they tell you that you'd be
able to summon a Sacred Beast?

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:02.940
In exchange for being an accomplice
in the theft of the stone tablet!

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:05.360
Sounds like that was the plan.

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.230
No!

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:11.030
Why can't you see it, Allen?
You're being used!

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:15.320
Shut up! You're just talking smack
because you're afraid of losing to me!

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:19.830
Looks like you won't come to your senses
unless my Draciel beats it into you!

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:20.830
What?

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.920
Let's go, Allen!

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:27.170
Any time!

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:29.170
This time, you're going down!

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:32.630
Uh oh! Looks like some sparks are
starting to fly between Max and Allen!

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:35.180
Are they going to
settle the score?

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:38.140
Three! Two! One!

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:39.470
Go, Shoot!

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:49.230
Don't lose, Draciel!

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:55.950
Hang in there, Impulse!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.040
W-wow!

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:03.000
What happened to Max?

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.370
I think his mind's clear this time.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:09.380
Keep it up, Max!

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:10.630
Go!

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:16.760
Wow! Now this is one intense
power-on-power clash!

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:21.100
Go, Impulse!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:22.850
Not bad, Allen.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:25.810
You haven't changed a bit.

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:30.360
Allen, there's no doubt
about it. You're my friend.

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:34.990
I can't lose to Max just because
I don't have a Sacred Beast!

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:37.610
Here I come, Max!

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:38.660
Come on!

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:57.800
Watch and learn, Allen!
This is my power!

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:00.850
Viper Wall!

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:01.890
What?!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:26.290
Max takes the win! Look at that
special move! It's wonderful!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:27.540
Incredible!

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:29.210
He had it in him after all!

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:32.380
That's the power of
the new Draciel!

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:35.300
Allen!

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:37.170
Allen...

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:38.590
Max...

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:42.930
I'll talk, just as I promised.
You were right.

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:46.310
I was an accomplice in the
plot to steal the tablet.

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:47.560
Allen...

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:53.190
I was introduced to the research
lab under the orders of the boss.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:56.780
The boss? Who is this person?

00:18:57.320 --> 00:19:00.660
She was a young woman
with blonde hair,

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:02.320
and I think she was Japanese.

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:03.990
Why do you think she's Japanese?

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:06.750
She used a bit of Japanese
when she talked on the phone.

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:08.750
And said she'd bring
the tablet to Japan.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:09.620
What?!

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:40.150
Allen, I just don't get it.

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:41.860
Why did you...?

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:45.950
I wanted a Sacred Beast.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:48.410
Why did you want one?

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:50.210
To fight you!

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:55.090
To fight on even ground with you,
who became the best in the world with one!

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:57.840
I needed a Sacred Beast, too...

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:00.630
The boss-woman who approached me...

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:05.300
She said she knew someone who could
create a Sacred Beast from the tablet.

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:10.180
And that she'd give me a Beyblade with a Sacred
Beast in it on the condition that I'd help her.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.140
Why would you do
something so foolish?

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:15.440
Foolish?! Don't you get it?

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:21.570
We've competed in everything since we
were little. And I've been able to win it all...

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:24.280
But there was just one
thing I couldn't beat you at...

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:27.280
And that was Beyblade!

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:30.750
I wanted to beat you in Beyblade.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:34.210
I wanted to beat you, even just once.

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:38.130
I wanted it so badly I
didn't think of anything else.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:41.090
Next thing I knew,
I was in your mom's lab...

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:42.380
Allen...

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:47.050
I had no idea you were
willing to go so far...

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:49.890
But I was wrong.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:52.930
I realized that once I was
able to fight you for real.

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:54.060
Max!

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.770
You've beaten me this time!

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:57.770
Allen...

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:01.860
But I'm happy. Thanks for
having a real battle with me.

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:05.530
Allen!

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:07.910
That was a nice battle!

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:09.580
It really was amazing!

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:10.910
It was moving.

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:12.080
Thanks.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.000
Let's go.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:17.920
Yes, sir.

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:24.340
Allen! Let's Beyblade again sometime!

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:27.890
Yeah! I won't lose next time!

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.550
Neither will I!

00:22:58.850 --> 00:23:02.480
We returned to Japan in search of the tablet.

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:04.980
Just who was it who stole it?

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:09.610
What'd you say, Chairman?
You saw the tablet 30 years ago?

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:12.570
Really? Thirty years ago...

00:23:12.570 --> 00:23:15.240
I'm sure you had plenty
of hair back then...

00:23:15.240 --> 00:23:17.950
In the next episode,
the mystery of the Chairman's hair--

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:21.790
No, I mean of the stone tablet!
You won't want to miss it!
